		<zType>TEXT_HELPTEXT_LINK_HELP_OPINION_FAMILY</zType>
		<en-US>link(CONCEPT_FAMILY) Opinion is categorized into 6 Levels: 
From Level 1: link(OPINIONFAMILY_FURIOUS) (Opinion lower than -200)
 to Level 6: link(OPINIONFAMILY_FRIENDLY) (Opinion higher than +199).
With no modifiers, Opinion will be at 0, which is Level 4:
 link(OPINIONFAMILY_CAUTIOUS) (Opinion from 0 to +99). 
Opinion Levels different from link(OPINIONFAMILY_CAUTIOUS) modify  icon(ATTACKDEFENSE)Strength of their Units and output of link(YIELD_CIVICS,1), link(YIELD_TRAINING,1), and link(YIELD_MAINTENANCE,1) of their Cities. Further, a negative link(CONCEPT_FAMILY) Opinion can lead to link(TRIBE_REBELS) spawning near their Cities.</en-US>
