		<en-US>You can use your link(COUNCIL_AMBASSADOR) to conduct diplomatic Missions. Just select the portrait of your link(COUNCIL_AMBASSADOR) in the top right, and you will see their available actions in the panel on the left side of the screen. An link(COUNCIL_AMBASSADOR) can make link(DIPLOMACY_PEACE) with link(CONCEPT_NATION,2) and link(CONCEPT_TRIBE,2), form a link(MISSION_TRADE_MISSION), offer and demand Tribute, and improve relations with Religions by holding a link(MISSION_HIGH_SYNOD)!	
	
Once you have researched the link(TECH_ARISTOCRACY) technology and you have an available candidate on your court with the link(TRAIT_ORATOR_ARCHETYPE), link(TRAIT_DIPLOMAT_ARCHETYPE), or link(TRAIT_COMMANDER_ARCHETYPE) Trait, then you may appoint link(COUNCIL_AMBASSADOR,1) using the glowing scroll icon  icon(COUNCIL_AMBASSADOR) in the top right of the screen.</en-US>
